.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104011","id":2718517202,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iCUfS","user":{"login":"sinewavey","id":90056029,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMDU2MDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90056029?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey","html_url":"https://github.com/sinewavey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinewavey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-12T16:51:30Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T16:53:56Z","body":"Hi,\n\nI was able to recreate this behavior with additional details, also with 4.4-stable.\n\nHere is an example script:\n\n```\nextends Node;\n\nvar shmem: PackedInt32Array;\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t_test(shmem);\n\treturn;\n\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif event is InputEventKey && event.is_pressed() && event.key_label == KEY_F1:\n\t\tget_tree().quit();\n\treturn;\n\nfunc _test(mem: PackedInt32Array) -> void:\n\tconst memsize: int = 16834;\n\n\tmem.resize(memsize);\n\t\n\tfor i in memsize:\n\t\tmem[i] = 0; \n\t\n\tbreakpoint;\t\n\treturn;\n```\n\n\nGoing between the two calls indeed saw additional memory usage taken.\nWhen exited forcefully or via SceneTree::quit(), I also saw reported memory increasing.\n\nHowever, when continuing on with execution, rather than closing the game while in a breakpoint pause, the memory was freed (even if from multiple accumulated runs).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718517202/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718705360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104011#issuecomment-2718705360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104011","id":2718705360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iDCbQ","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-12T18:07:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T18:07:45Z","body":"- Same as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78526","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718705360/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized